The EOS G.Lite® sleeping bag is a soft and lightweight two-season sleeping system. It features a warm, synthetic filling that offers superior performance without the drawbacks of other synthetic-filled sleeping bag fills. The product complies with ASTM F2100 specifications. The G.Lite is available in three sizes: medium, large and extra large. G.Lite will provide superior thermal efficiency at a lightweight and comfortable size (10 - 15 pounds). Features and Specifications G.Lite Features Large (G2L): Sleeping bag - 3/4-inch quilted exterior (6 x 4 inches; 8 x 4 inches for double) - Waterproof nylon shell, with outer layer of waterproof nylon zipper (10 ounces) - Water resistance: 30-minute submersion in cold water (60-minute submersion in warm water) - Cold Zone: 30° to -15°F (Zones: 1, 2, 3 (10-14°C, -12 -9°C, -18 -7°C)) 2-layer quilt (6 x 4 inches; 8 x 4 inches for double) - Internal insulation - Lightweight design (10 -15 pounds) - Water-Repellent nylon liner (7 x 6 inches; 10 x 6 inches for double) 2-layer quilt - Lightweight, durable, waterproof shell with double-zipper pull and fastener on left side - Water repellent, quick-dry, washable nylon liner (7 x 6 inches; 10 x 6 inches for double) 2 - Layer, quick-drying, waterproof, waffle weave fabric with 100% waterproof zippers and zippers lining the footbox, hood, and neck (10 x 6 inches; 10 x 6 inches for double) - Lightweight,

